amai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3429980/2dd9e45eee8c60ed9ce85504a9f64804d16ee31b/ss_2dd9e45eee8c60ed9ce85504a9f64804d16ee31b.1920x1080.jpg?t=1745474796","path_thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3429980/2dd9e45eee8c60ed9ce85504a9f64804d16ee31b/ss_2dd9e45eee8c60ed9ce85504a9f64804d16ee31b.600x338.jpg?t=1745474796"}],"short_description":"On a planet with a biome climate similar to Earth, manage your residents from basic construction and planting, develop and research various cutting-edge technologies, recruit soldiers to form troops, resist foreign enemies or actively conquer other countries, and unify this distant planet.","steam_appid":3429980,"support_info":{"email":"zitaosoft@qq.com","url":""},"supported_languages":"English, French, German, Japanese, Simplified Chinese","type":"game","website":null}